// Purpose:
// Thunk snapshot・再代入・latent failure
// Based on tests (source-visible behavior; host/internal assertions remain unit tests):
// tests/test_call_inference.py::test_thunk_latent_effect_uses_selected_implementation
// tests/test_failure_contract.py::test_samples_outputs_and_warnings
// tests/test_function_locals.py::test_local_thunk_latent_failure_and_function_contract
